{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204530/extras/ce15782a407dc08ee98fa5d17639b26b.avif?t=1757525234\" width=600 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pip Pepper Park Planner</strong> is an <i>upcoming </i> <i>cozy</i>, <i>strategy</i> game in which you play as <strong>Pip</strong>, a <i>tiny</i> bird with a <i>giant </i>job: to design parks for animals to enjoy. Explore different habitats, discover the needs of diverse animals and fully customize your parks. <i>Can you build a park that all the animals will love?\u200e </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GAME TO REFLECT ON THE SPACES WE SHARE\u200e </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204530/extras/312b6fc89c81bfe8442504a869fe78a9.poster.avif?t=1757525234\" width=600 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204530/extras/312b6fc89c81bfe8442504a869fe78a9.webm?t=1757525234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204530/extras/312b6fc89c81bfe8442504a869fe78a9.mp4?t=1757525234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR CHOICES HAVE AN IMPACT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204530/extras/d67fe4e1f0e8e58594a6ade3101bc1c1.poster.avif?t=1757525234\" width=600 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204530/extras/d67fe4e1f0e8e58594a6ade3101bc1c1.webm?t=1757525234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create</strong> your own fully customizable park choosing different structures for each park area. With hundreds possible combinations, you get to decide what happens next. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204530/extras/f4fc8cc289f286e06a290ac457c63999.poster.avif?t=1757525234\" width=600 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204530/extras/f4fc8cc289f286e06a290ac457c63999.webm?t=1757525234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204530/extras/f4fc8cc289f286e06a290ac457c63999.mp4?t=1757525234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact</strong> with a variety of objects and animal species. Learn about their unique needs and interests through engaging and fun dialogue sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204530/extras/fce218a42e0fc092d6c3823fa4dd5d66.poster.avif?t=1757525234\" width=600 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204530/extras/fce218a42e0fc092d6c3823fa4dd5d66.webm?t=1757525234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204530/extras/fce218a42e0fc092d6c3823fa4dd5d66.mp4?t=1757525234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> a playground of possibilities.<i> Did anything change after building your park?</i> Take your time to reflect on your design decisions. You can always try  a new combination! 